Identical 4-line method at analyzers/AgentGuard.Analyzers.Tests/EngineToBoundariesOneDoorAnalyzerTests.cs:223-226, analyzers/AgentGuard.Analyzers.Tests/OneDoorIntoCrossPlatformAnalyzerTests.cs:317-320, and analyzers/AgentGuard.Analyzers.Tests/OneDoorIntoPerOsAnalyzerTests.cs:330-333 — read directly, all three read `private static string Message(Diagnostic diagnostic)
{
    return diagnostic.GetMessage(CultureInfo.InvariantCulture);
}`. `git ls-tree -r HEAD -- analyzers/AgentGuard.Analyzers.Tests | grep '\.cs$' | xargs grep -l "GetMessage(CultureInfo"` finds 6 pre-existing test files (e.g. NoLiteralFakeRootAnalyzerTests.cs) that call `diagnostic.GetMessage(CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)` inline at each assertion with no such wrapper anywhere in the codebase before this change — so this is a new, self-invented 3x duplicate, not an established idiom this work is merely following. Rails-dry-code Violation 6 (duplicated whole function).
